解：先求一阶导数：
$$\frac{dy}{dx}=\frac{3a\sin^2t\cos t}{-3a\cos^2t\sin t}=-\tan t.$$
二阶导数为
$$\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\frac{\frac{d}{dt}\left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)}{\frac{dx}{dt}}
=\frac{-\sec^2t}{-3a\cos^2t\sin t}
=\frac{1}{3a\cos^4t\sin t}.$$

